WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.927
These are the main habits from Module 13.

00:00:02.927 --> 00:00:06.137
Keep the relational thinking you built earlier.

00:00:06.137 --> 00:00:13.737
Add distributed cost awareness. Use raw files, temporary views, and Delta tables deliberately.

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:22.543
Inspect plans. Validate outputs. And match the tool to the workload instead of assuming Spark is always better.
